{"id": 1010208, "slug": "baki-hanma-blood-arena", "name": "Baki Hanma: Blood Arena", "name_original": "Baki Hanma: Blood Arena", "description": "<p>Enter the brutal world of Baki Hanma: Blood Arena, a thrilling 2D action game inspired by the Netflix anime phenomenon Baki. With gameplay reminiscent of the classic Super Punch-Out!!, this game blends precision, timing, and shonen-style flair to deliver a high-energy combat experience.</p><p> Take on the role of the world’s most determined fighter in a quest to prove your strength.</p><p> </p><p>Each enemy is a master of their own fighting style, presenting unique challenges and requiring different strategies to defeat.</p><p>Fight across iconic battle arenas, from underground fight clubs to majestic tournament stages.</p><p> </p><p>Unleash explosive special moves inspired by the anime to dominate your opponents.</p><p>Immerse yourself in a custom score that captures the intensity and emotion of the Baki universe.</p><p>Face off against the ultimate enemy, the strongest creature alive, in a battle for the title of god of combat.</p><p> </p><p>Are you ready to step into the arena and claim your place as the strongest? Only the most skilled and determined will conquer the Blood Arena.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-09-11", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-09-12T08:35:41", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/6e0/6e084166d173f06dbbcd85b884a3741d.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/89e/89e856883b7a1aae8c27e365c9f00699.jpg", "website": "https://www.purpleplay.games/bakihanmabloodarena", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 3, "added_by_status": {"owned": 2, "playing": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 14, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "